     "caption": "\"Is this a decision or a discussion?\"\n\nTwo completely different meetings. Different prep, different pace, different exit. And almost nobody says which one they booked.\n\nThe invite said \"sync\". It was a decision. Half the room came ready to chat, the other half came ready to vote. Both left annoyed, for opposite reasons.\n\nHalf of all bad meetings are two meetings happening in the same room at the same time. Ask the question in the first minute and you get one meeting back.\n\nDecision or discussion: which one do you get more of? 👇",
